// #3591: `derive (Show)` renders a tuple payload component by component, so
// `(Int, Set[Int])` goes through `Set::to_string`, which `Set` does not
// provide. This was reported clean and the build stopped with an internal
// compiler error (`Set::to_string` reached code generation unresolved). It is
// refused at `E` now, naming the edit.
import @vibe/core { struct Set }

enum E {
  Pair((Int, Set[Int]));
  Empty
} derive (Show)
